  "source": "services/task/app/schemas/*.py — Pydantic response models read directly, NOT live captures. The FastAPI task-service is not running in this environment (see backend/README-tests.md), so no shape here was recorded from a real response. A later engineer who spins up the original stack should replace these with captured responses; the checking helpers can stay. cms keeps one file per schema; tasks has a dozen response models, so they share one keyed file — same provenance rule, one place to look.",
